text tome lore mabrahoring~
It takes near all your strength to pick this massive book off the floor,
why it must contain thousands upon thousands of pages! You wipe the
thick layer of dust off the cover and notice a large symbol emblazoned
on its cover. Unable to comprehend it, you turn to the first page. Amazing..
what you seem to have in your hands is a veritable Key to translating
the language of the Hells into other languages. Page after page has
verses of common, elvish, orcish, dwarven, and so on compared to what you
learn is called 'Mabrahoring', the language of the Hells.
Perhaps if you had a year or so to study, you could become well read in
devilish texts.
~
