avernus~
   One day a powerful god named Xiuhtecuhtli made a bet with the mortal known
as Xandor.  Xiuhtecuhtli promised Xandor a powerful weapon if he should win his
wager.  However, if he lost his wager he would be forced to give up his very
own prized weapon.  As it turned out, Xandor won the Wager and demanded his
powerful artifact.  Incensed by loosing the wager and being known as a poor
looser Xiuhtecuhtli warped the weapon you hold in your hand.  The once
beneficial gift it granted to the wielder was twisted and manipulated into a
curse.  Anyone who dares use this weapon will feel the sting of Xiuhtecuhtli's
maliciousness.    
